  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MA-Empowering youth as agents of change in rural Cambodian communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will build the capacity and develop the critical thinking skills of youth in regard to social and governance issues, community organizing, sustainable development, financial literacy and accountability. By working with rural youth groups and using a participatory approach, it will empower youth to be agents of change in their local communities.</narrative>
  </description>
